## sister drmTMB profile-plot pattern; both packages are GPL-3 by Shinichi
## Nakagawa. R/plot-gllvmTMB.R acknowledges the gllvm2lev plotting interface as
## conceptual inspiration and is independently implemented. The production
## logo at man/figures/logo.png was restored from Shinichi Nakagawa's legacy
## gllvmTMB repository. On 2026-08-08 the maintainer explicitly confirmed that
